    "scenesThatPass": [
      "CHOU: Let’s go\nCHOU: What are you doing?\nLOUNG: Trying to loosen the body to float down stream.\nLOUNG: On three.",
      "LOUNG: What happens when people die?\nCHOU: First they sleep peacefully not knowing they are dead. They sleep for three days and then on the third day they wake up. That’s when they re…\nLOUNG: When will they come back?\nCHOU: I don’t know.",
      "LOUNG: I’m going to kill them one day.\nLOUNG: You don’t think I can? I can.\nCHOU: I don’t want you to. I don’t want anyone to kill anyone.",
      "MET BONG: Comrade, what are you doing here?\nLOUNG: Met Bong, my sister and I are orphans looking for a place to live.\nMET BONG: How old are you?\nLOUNG: I am seven. She is ten.",
      "MET SREI: Where have you been?\nLOUNG: I went to see my sister.\nMET SREI: And stayed there for three days?\nLOUNG: I don’t know. I don’t know where I was."
    ]
